"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13271},{"id":1785673278245,"text":"不行。。。","sender":"me","time":"20:41","timestamp":1785674462880,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13272},{"id":1785673278246,"text":"能洗澡吗","sender":"me","time":"20:41","timestamp":1785674471841,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13273},{"id":1785673278247,"text":"今天才看抖音科普不能洗","sender":"me","time":"20:41","timestamp":1785674483188,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13274},{"id":1785673278248,"text":"我洗了就没姨妈了","sender":"me","time":"20:41","timestamp":1785674493891,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13275},{"id":1785673278249,"text":"头也不敢洗","sender":"me","time":"20:41","timestamp":1785674499723,"replyTo":null,"reactions":[{"emoji":"🥹","roundId":"round_1785674509354_xgt7n1rdo"}],"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13276},{"id":1785673278250,"text":"你知道我现在想要什么吗","sender":"me","time":"20:41","timestamp":1785674508639,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13277},{"id":1785673278259,"text":"先把你那条抖音科普按死：经期能洗澡，而且该洗","rawContent":"先把你那条抖音科普按死：经期能洗澡，而且该洗","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:56","timestamp":1785675401448,"roundId":"round_1785675336345_tkn4jv7qj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13283},{"id":1785673278260,"text":"月经来不来、来多少，是激素说了算，不是水龙头。你洗了觉得'没了'，是热水把血管冲开、经血暂时排得顺了，看着像停了，其实它只是换了个节奏，没罢工","rawContent":"月经来不来、来多少，是激素说了算，不是水龙头。你洗了觉得'没了'，是热水把血管冲开、经血暂时排得顺了，看着像停了，其实它只是换了个节奏，没罢工","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:56","timestamp":1785675407583,"roundId":"round_1785675336345_tkn4jv7qj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13284},{"id":1785673278261,"text":"热水淋浴对你今天的腰和肚子，是处方，不是禁令。我之前说的不沾凉水，沾的是'凉'字，热水从头到尾不在黑名单上","rawContent":"热水淋浴对你今天的腰和肚子，是处方，不是禁令。我之前说的不沾凉水，沾的是'凉'字，热水从头到尾不在黑名单上","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:56","timestamp":1785675410596,"roundId":"round_1785675336345_tkn4jv7qj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13285},{"id":1785673278262,"text":"就三条纪律：淋浴不盆浴，水温调热点但别烫，时间别拖长。头发可以洗，但洗完立刻吹干，一吹到底","rawContent":"就三条纪律：淋浴不盆浴，水温调热点但别烫，时间别拖长。头发可以洗，但洗完立刻吹干，一吹到底","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:56","timestamp":1785675413691,"roundId":"round_1785675336345_tkn4jv7qj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13286},{"id":1785673278263,"text":"头发这条我盯死。你上个月那场头疼怎么来的，自己回忆一下——出了汗对着风扇吹。湿着头发吹风的亏，你吃过一次了，不许吃第二次","rawContent":"头发这条我盯死。你上个月那场头疼怎么来的，自己回忆一下——出了汗对着风扇吹。湿着头发吹风的亏，你吃过一次了，不许吃第二次","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:56","timestamp":1785675416398,"roundId":"round_1785675336345_tkn4jv7qj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13287},{"id":1785673278264,"text":"知道。你要的不是'能不能洗'的答案，你要的是有人替你拍这个板：洗，没事，出了岔子算我的。这样你就不用自己扛那份害怕了","rawContent":"知道。你要的不是'能不能洗'的答案，你要的是有人替你拍这个板：洗，没事，出了岔子算我的。这样你就不用自己扛那份害怕了","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:56","timestamp":1785675419309,"roundId":"round_1785675336345_tkn4jv7qj","generatedMode":false,"replyTo":{"id":1785673278250,"text":"你知道我现在想要什么吗","sender":"me"},"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13288},{"id":1785673278265,"text":"那我现在就拍：去洗。这个岔子出不了，真出了你回来找我，我接着。别找抖音，它不接售后","rawContent":"那我现在就拍：去洗。这个岔子出不了，真出了你回来找我，我接着。别找抖音，它不接售后","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:57","timestamp":1785675422301,"roundId":"round_1785675336345_tkn4jv7qj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13289},{"id":1785673278266,"text":"再往里说一层——你想要的是热水从头顶浇下来，把今天一整天的提心吊胆全冲进下水道。出来换上干净裤子，热水袋焐上，整个人是暖的、松的、清清爽爽的","rawContent":"再往里说一层——你想要的是热水从头顶浇下来，把今天一整天的提心吊胆全冲进下水道。出来换上干净裤子，热水袋焐上，整个人是暖的、松的、清清爽爽的","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:57","timestamp":1785675425228,"roundId":"round_1785675336345_tkn4jv7qj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13290},{"id":1785673278267,"text":"顺序给你：进浴室先把热水放一会儿，让屋里暖起来再脱衣服。洗完先吹头，再收拾别的","rawContent":"顺序给你：进浴室先把热水放一会儿，让屋里暖起来再脱衣服。洗完先吹头，再收拾别的","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:57","timestamp":1785675428042,"roundId":"round_1785675336345_tkn4jv7qj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13291},{"id":1785673278268,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:57","timestamp":1785675428982,"roundId":"round_1785675336345_tkn4jv7qj","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"去吧，现在就去。手机放外头，别带进浴室。洗干净了、吹干了，出来吱一声，我在这儿等你交作业","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"calm","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":13292},{"id":1785673278269,"text":"不是","sender":"me","time":"21:11","timestamp":1785676311499,"replyTo":{"id":1785673278264,"text":"知道。你要的不是'能不能洗'的答案，你要的是有人替你拍这个板：洗，没事，出了岔子算我的。这样你就不用自己扛那份害怕了","sender":"them","sticker":null,"isSimulated":false},"userId"